1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,047
Booking the Royalton Punta Cana?

2
00:00:02,067 --> 00:00:03,999
Here's what to know before you pay.

3
00:00:04,449 --> 00:00:08,747
A four and a half star, all inclusive
resort, in the Dominican Republic.

4
00:00:09,397 --> 00:00:11,549
Guests rate it seven point eight out of
ten.

5
00:00:12,999 --> 00:00:15,880
It has three hundred seventeen rooms, and
three pools.

6
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:19,292
It has ten restaurants and ten bars.

7
00:00:20,742 --> 00:00:24,748
And it sits on the beach, about twenty
five to thirty minutes from the airport.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,044
First, what's worth your time.

9
00:00:29,064 --> 00:00:31,410
And stay until the end, for the honest
score.

10
00:00:33,517 --> 00:00:34,743
The beach comes first.

11
00:00:34,763 --> 00:00:38,275
Then three pools, and free access to the
water park next door.

12
00:00:38,776 --> 00:00:44,164
Then the room. It comes with a balcony or
a terrace, and some suites have a semi
private pool.

13
00:00:44,664 --> 00:00:46,603
And the meal worth planning for.

14
00:00:46,623 --> 00:00:48,378
The buffet is open every day:

15
00:00:48,398 --> 00:00:54,255
breakfast from seven to ten thirty, lunch
from noon to three thirty, and dinner from
six to ten.

16
00:00:54,275 --> 00:00:57,275
Then the a la carte restaurants, open for
dinner.

17
00:00:58,167 --> 00:00:59,733
Now, what does it really cost?

18
00:01:01,283 --> 00:01:06,632
With the all inclusive package, you get
the room, the buffet, the pools, the
beach, and free wifi.

19
00:01:07,132 --> 00:01:11,881
Not included: the chef's table, the
premium drinks, the spa, and the
excursions.

20
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:14,423
Hidden fees? I found no resort fee.

21
00:01:14,443 --> 00:01:18,215
And the ten dollar tourist card is already
in your plane ticket.

22
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:20,686
So, what do guests really say?

23
00:01:22,217 --> 00:01:23,716
Here's what's behind that score.

24
00:01:24,216 --> 00:01:26,652
What guests love: the beach is right
outside.

25
00:01:27,152 --> 00:01:28,612
The staff is very helpful.

26
00:01:29,112 --> 00:01:30,892
And the food has real variety.

27
00:01:31,392 --> 00:01:32,733
What they complain about:

28
00:01:32,753 --> 00:01:33,897
the rooms look dated.

29
00:01:34,397 --> 00:01:35,939
Seaweed can cover the beach.

30
00:01:36,439 --> 00:01:38,153
And shaded loungers go early.

31
00:01:39,617 --> 00:01:40,726
Now, the don't list.

32
00:01:40,746 --> 00:01:42,362
Don't pay for the entry form.

33
00:01:42,382 --> 00:01:43,793
The official one is free.

34
00:01:44,293 --> 00:01:47,370
Don't buy a shuttle from a desk inside the
terminal.

35
00:01:47,390 --> 00:01:49,117
Go to the official taxi desk.

36
00:01:49,618 --> 00:01:51,229
And don't expect an elevator.

37
00:01:51,249 --> 00:01:53,331
The hotel has three levels, and none.

38
00:01:54,234 --> 00:01:55,679
Now, where is it exactly?

39
00:01:57,217 --> 00:02:02,528
The nearest airport is Punta Cana
International, about twenty five to thirty
minutes by road.

40
00:02:03,028 --> 00:02:05,832
An official taxi costs about twenty five
dollars.

41
00:02:06,333 --> 00:02:08,965
Up to thirty five, per car, not per
person.

42
00:02:09,465 --> 00:02:13,503
Around the hotel, Punta Blanca Golf is
about seven minutes by car.

43
00:02:14,003 --> 00:02:16,092
Cana Bay Golf is about ten minutes.

44
00:02:16,592 --> 00:02:19,363
And Macao Beach is about seventeen minutes
by car.

45
00:02:20,867 --> 00:02:21,841
When should you go?

46
00:02:23,483 --> 00:02:25,816
The best weather runs from December to
April.

47
00:02:26,316 --> 00:02:27,901
That's also when prices peak.

48
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:33,633
From June to November is hurricane season,
and the highest risk is August to October.

49
00:02:34,133 --> 00:02:35,795
The sweet spot is November:

50
00:02:35,815 --> 00:02:39,677
the storm risk drops, the seaweed fades,
and prices are lower.

51
00:02:41,167 --> 00:02:42,383
And now, the verdict.

52
00:02:43,917 --> 00:02:46,504
It's great for families, and for beach
lovers.

53
00:02:47,004 --> 00:02:50,634
It's not for fans of brand new rooms, or
seaweed free beaches.

54
00:02:51,134 --> 00:02:53,557
The honest score: seven and a half out of
ten.

55
00:02:57,367 --> 00:02:59,288
That was the Royalton Punta Cana.

56
00:02:59,308 --> 00:03:01,464
Which hotel should we check out next?

57
00:03:01,484 --> 00:03:02,896
Tell me in the comments.
